<title>USA: First Data to offer services to SunTrust.</title>
<headline>First Data to offer services to SunTrust.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp. said its card services unit will provide credit card processing services to SunTrust Banks Inc.</p>
<p>First Data will offer transaction processing services for SunTrust BankCard's 1.1 million credit card, debit card and equity line clients in addition to providing statement rendering, card embossing and other services.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>First Data provides payment system and information management services to a variety of companies.</p>
<p>The company's stock was up 1/8 Monday at 37.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
